Package: cinminai-sidebar
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Cin-MinAI <https://github.com/Cin-MinAI/Cin-MinAI>
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.12), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, libx11-6, cinminai-daemon (>= @RELEASE@)
Description: Cin-MinAI assistant sidebar
 The window where you talk to the Cin-MinAI assistant: docked on the right edge
 of the screen, it keeps its own space so other windows don't cover it. Answers
 appear as they are written, and every check or lookup the assistant does is
 shown in plain words. Open it from the menu, the panel, or with Super+A.
